10:36 Incident resolved

==================================================
45. MEMORY LEARNING
==================================================

After every resolved incident:

Create memory record:

{
  "incident_type": "...",
  "symptoms": "...",
  "root_cause": "...",
  "fix": "...",
  "verification": "...",
  "outcome": "SUCCESS",
  "environment": "production"
}

Embed it and store in Qdrant.

On future incidents, retrieve top-k similar incidents.

Display:
"Similar incidents found: 3"

==================================================
46. IMPORTANT SAFETY PRINCIPLE
==================================================

Use this rule throughout the project:

AGENTS PROPOSE.
CONTROL LAYER AUTHORIZES.
EXECUTOR EXECUTES.
VERIFIER PROVES.

Never violate this architecture.

The LLM must NOT:
- directly write production SQL
- directly execute arbitrary SQL
- approve its own high-risk action
- declare success without deterministic verification
- bypass human approval
- modify audit logs
- disable safety controls

