The final implementation should allow me to describe the project on my resume approximately as:

"Built a closed-loop autonomous data incident resolution platform using LangGraph, FastAPI, Exasol, PostgreSQL and Qdrant that automatically investigates data-quality incidents, generates remediation plans, validates fixes in an isolated sandbox, performs deterministic verification and risk assessment, supports human approval and rollback, and stores resolved incidents as vector memory for future root-cause analysis."

